  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: Parfois il faut prendre sur toi Camil.
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Ah d\u2019accord\u2026Je prendrais sur moi alors."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "C\u2019est juste un coup de chiffon, c\u2019est pas si terrible."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Mais tu me mets mal \xE0 l\u2019aise Liski."
